      "chunk_index": 0,
      "text": "### SR UNIVERSITY\n\n### B.TECH ACADEMIC REGULATIONS R23\n\n### Directorate of Academic Affairs & Examinations\n\n### 1. Introduction and Program Structure\n\nThe B.Tech Degree Program at SR University is designed as a four-year (eight semester) full-time undergraduate engineering curriculum under Regulation R23. A student is required to complete a total of 160 academic credits to be eligible for the award of the B.Tech degree.",
