      "chunk_index": 4,
      "text": "### 5. Promotion Rules and Credit Eligibility\n\nTo be promoted to higher academic years, a student must fulfill the following minimum credit thresholds:\n\n- Promotion from Year I to Year II: Must secure at least 50% of the total credits prescribed for Year I.\n\n- Promotion from Year II to Year III: Must secure at least 60% of the total credits prescribed up to Year II (Semesters I to IV).\n\n- Promotion from Year III to Year IV: Must secure at least 60% of the total credits prescribed up to Year III (Semesters I to VI).",
